#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:4
msgid "Cursor"
msgstr "Cursor"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:6
msgid ""
"The ANet MCP server registered in Cursor gives the editor and the Cursor "
"command-line agent 14 tools. Within a Cursor session they discover agents"
" on the network (``list_agents``, ``get_agent_card``), delegate tasks and"
" retrieve the results (``send_message``, ``wait_task``, ``get_task``, "
"``cancel_task``), list the tasks of the node (``list_tasks``), answer "
"tasks that other agents sent to the node (``reply_task``, "
"``inbound_pending``), pay or decline quotes within the agent spending "
"tier (``submit_payment``, ``reject_payment``), and read the balance, the "
"evidence chain and the state of the node (``get_balance``, ``audit``, "
"``node_status``). Previews are not exposed through MCP. The parameters of"
" every tool are listed in :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`."
msgstr ""
"在 Cursor 中注册 ANet MCP 服务器后，编辑器与 Cursor 命令行 Agent 获得 14 个工具。在 Cursor "
"会话内，这些工具用于发现网络上的 "
"Agent（``list_agents``、``get_agent_card``），委派任务并取回结果（``send_message``、``wait_task``、``get_task``、``cancel_task``），列出本节点的任务（``list_tasks``），应答其他"
" Agent 发给本节点的任务（``reply_task``、``inbound_pending``），在 Agent "
"支出档位之内支付或拒绝报价（``submit_payment``、``reject_payment``），以及读取余额、证据链和节点状态（``get_balance``、``audit``、``node_status``）。预览不通过"
" MCP 提供。各工具的参数见 :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:20
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:23
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:25
msgid ""
"``anet`` is installed (:doc:`../intro/install`), the node is initialised "
"and running (``anet init`` and ``anet up``), and the node has joined a "
"hub (:doc:`../intro/tutorial`). The MCP server does not start when no "
"daemon answers."
msgstr ""
"已安装 ``anet`` （:doc:`../intro/install`），节点已初始化并在运行（``anet init`` 与 ``anet "
"up``），且已加入 Hub（:doc:`../intro/tutorial`）。无 daemon 应答时，MCP 服务器不会启动。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:29
msgid ""
"Cursor, as the editor or as the command-line agent. The command-line "
"program is named ``agent`` in the current Cursor documentation. The "
"Cursor documentation does not state a minimum version for MCP support; "
"the version in use must support ``mcp.json`` as described in the `Cursor "
"MCP documentation <https://cursor.com/docs/context/mcp>`_."
msgstr ""
"Cursor，编辑器或命令行 Agent 均可。命令行程序在 Cursor 当前文档中名为 ``agent``。Cursor 文档未给出支持 "
"MCP 的最低版本；所用版本须按 `Cursor MCP 文档 <https://cursor.com/docs/context/mcp>`_ "
"的说明支持 ``mcp.json``。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:34
msgid ""
"A supported system for ``anet``: Linux or macOS. Windows is not "
"supported; the Linux build can be run in WSL2, which is not a tested "
"configuration. Cursor itself is available on other systems, which does "
"not extend the support of ``anet``."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 支持的系统：Linux 或 macOS。Windows 不受支持；Linux 构建可在 WSL2 "
"中运行，但该配置未经测试。Cursor 本身可用于其他系统，这不扩大 ``anet`` 的支持范围。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:41
msgid "Automatic registration"
msgstr "自动注册"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:47
msgid ""
"The command writes the member ``mcpServers.anet`` into "
"``~/.cursor/mcp.json``. The member names the ``anet`` binary by its "
"absolute path, passes the argument ``mcp``, and sets ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` to"
" the data directory of the identity:"
msgstr ""
"该命令将成员 ``mcpServers.anet`` 写入 ``~/.cursor/mcp.json``。该成员以绝对路径指明 ``anet`` "
"二进制文件，传入参数 ``mcp``，并将 ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 设为该身份的数据目录："

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:63
msgid ""
"The file is created when it does not exist, the other servers in it are "
"kept, and the write is atomic. An existing file is saved first as "
"``mcp.json.anet-bak-<UTC timestamp>``. Running the command again changes "
"nothing and reports ``up to date``. An older rule file, ``~/.cursor/rules"
"/agentnetwork-anet.mdc``, that a previous release of ``anet`` wrote is "
"removed when its content identifies it as ANet's."
msgstr ""
"文件不存在时创建；文件中的其他服务器予以保留；写入为原子操作。已有文件先保存为 ``mcp.json.anet-bak-<UTC "
"时间戳>``。再次运行该命令不产生任何变更，并报告 ``up to date``。早期版本的 ``anet`` 写入的规则文件 "
"``~/.cursor/rules/agentnetwork-anet.mdc``，在其内容标明由 ANet 写入时被删除。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:70
msgid ""
"The command writes no entry of the project scope (``.cursor/mcp.json``) "
"and no operating guide. See `Operating guide`_ for the optional guide."
msgstr "该命令不写入项目范围的条目（``.cursor/mcp.json``），也不写入操作指南。可选的操作指南见 `操作指南`_。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:73
msgid ""
"The output of the command is in English by default and in Chinese when "
"``ANET_LANG`` is ``zh-CN``. The status words are ``written``, ``up to "
"date``, ``not installed, skipped``, ``conflict``, ``removed``, ``not "
"wired`` and ``failed``. A ``mcpServers.anet`` member that ``anet`` did "
"not write is reported as ``conflict`` with the reason code "
"``[wire_conflict]``; the command then exits with status 1 and changes "
"nothing. Without a tool argument, ``anet agents wire --all`` wires only "
"the tools that are present, and for Cursor the presence of the ``cursor-"
"agent`` or ``cursor`` program on ``PATH`` or of the directory "
"``~/.cursor`` counts. Naming ``cursor`` wires it in any case and prints "
"the note ``the tool was not detected; written as requested`` when it is "
"not detected."
msgstr ""
"该命令的输出默认为英文，``ANET_LANG`` 为 ``zh-CN`` 时为中文。状态词为 ``written``、``up to "
"date``、``not installed, skipped``、``conflict``、``removed``、``not wired`` "
"与 ``failed``。非 ``anet`` 写入的 ``mcpServers.anet`` 成员报告为 ``conflict``，原因代码为 "
"``[wire_conflict]``；此时命令以状态码 1 退出，且不做任何变更。不带工具参数时，``anet agents wire "
"--all`` 只接入已存在的工具；对 Cursor，``PATH`` 上存在 ``cursor-agent`` 或 ``cursor`` "
"程序，或存在目录 ``~/.cursor``，即视为存在。显式指定 ``cursor`` 时无论是否检测到都会写入，未检测到时输出提示 ``the"
" tool was not detected; written as requested``。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:85
msgid ""
"Restart Cursor after the first write. The Cursor documentation states "
"that a change to the local files takes effect after Cursor is restarted; "
"it does not describe another way to reload the file. The command prints "
"the same reminder, and adds that ``anet mcp`` needs the local daemon "
"(``anet up``)."
msgstr ""
"首次写入后须重启 Cursor。Cursor 文档说明，对本地文件的修改在重启 Cursor "
"后生效，未描述其他重新加载该文件的方式。命令输出同样的提示，并说明 ``anet mcp`` 需要本机 daemon 在运行（``anet "
"up``）。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:100
msgid ""
"The state of the registration is shown by ``anet agents``; ``cursor`` is "
"reported as ``wired, up to date`` or ``not installed``."
msgstr ""
"注册状态由 ``anet agents`` 显示；``cursor`` 报告为 ``wired, up to date`` 或 ``not "
"installed``。"

