" a Cursor client. The fields ``command``, ``args``, ``env`` and "
"``envFile`` and the variables ``${env:NAME}``, ``${userHome}``, "
"``${workspaceFolder}``, ``${workspaceFolderBasename}`` and "
"``${pathSeparator}`` are described in the Cursor documentation."
