#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:217
msgid ""
"Cursor asks for approval before it uses an MCP tool by default. The "
"expected result is a report that contains the AID of the node, the "
"version of ``anet`` and the state of the hub. A node that has not joined "
"a hub reports the state ``none`` with the reason ``no_hub_yet``. A "
"failure to connect indicates that the daemon is not running; running "
"``anet mcp`` on a terminal then prints the cause:"
msgstr ""
"Cursor 默认在使用 MCP 工具之前请求批准。预期结果是一份报告，其中包含节点的 AID、``anet`` 的版本和 Hub 状态。尚未加入"
" Hub 的节点报告状态 ``none``，原因为 ``no_hub_yet``。连接失败表示 daemon 未运行；此时在终端运行 ``anet"
" mcp`` 会输出原因："

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:228
