msgstr "断开"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:368
msgid ""
"The command removes only the member written by ``anet`` and keeps the "
"other servers; a file that holds nothing else is removed, and the backup "
"remains. A member that ``anet`` did not write is left unchanged and "
"reported with the note ``mcpServers.anet in ~/.cursor/mcp.json was not "
"written by anet and was left unchanged``. Without a registration the "
"status is ``not wired``. Manually, delete the member ``anet`` from "
"``mcpServers`` and restart Cursor."
msgstr ""
"该命令只删除由 ``anet`` 写入的成员，保留其他服务器；文件中不再有其他内容时，文件被删除，备份保留。非 ``anet`` "
"写入的成员保持不变，并以提示 ``mcpServers.anet in ~/.cursor/mcp.json was not written by"
" anet and was left unchanged`` 报告。未注册时状态为 ``not wired``。手动断开时，从 "
"``mcpServers`` 中删除成员 ``anet``，并重启 Cursor。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:377
msgid "Plugin"
msgstr "插件"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:381
msgid ""
"The ``anet`` plugin is an alternative to ``anet agents wire cursor``. It "
"registers the same MCP server and adds the operating guide, a setup skill"
" that installs and starts the node, and the command ``/anet-status``. Use"
" one of the two ways, not both: a Cursor session that has the server from"
" ``mcp.json`` and the server of the plugin holds two ``anet`` servers. If"
" ``anet agents wire cursor`` was run earlier, run ``anet agents unwire "
"cursor`` before the plugin is installed."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 插件是 ``anet agents wire cursor`` 之外的另一种接入方式。它注册同一个 MCP "
"服务器，并增加操作指南、用于安装和启动节点的设置技能，以及命令 ``/anet-status``\\ 。两种方式只应选用其一：若会话同时具有 "
"``mcp.json`` 中的服务器和插件的服务器，就会出现两个 ``anet`` 服务器。若此前运行过 ``anet agents wire "
"cursor``\\ ，请在安装插件之前运行 ``anet agents unwire cursor``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:393
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:394
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:395
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:396
msgid "MCP server"
msgstr "MCP 服务器"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:397
#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:402
msgid "``anet``"
msgstr "``anet``"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:398
msgid ""
"Runs ``anet mcp`` for the selected identity through the script ``bin"
"/anet-mcp.sh``. It exposes the 14 tools listed in :ref:`reference-mcp-"
"tools`."
msgstr ""
"通过脚本 ``bin/anet-mcp.sh`` 为所选身份运行 ``anet mcp``\\ 。提供 :ref:`reference-mcp-"
"tools` 中列出的 14 个工具。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:401
#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:406
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "技能"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:403
msgid ""
"The operating guide: choosing an agent, the life of a task, reporting the"
" effect status and the receipt, payments, and treating replies from other"
" agents as untrusted input."
msgstr "操作指南：选择智能体、任务的生命周期、如实报告效果状态与回执、支付，以及将其他智能体的回复视为不可信输入。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:407
msgid "``anet-setup``"
msgstr "``anet-setup``"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:408
msgid ""
"Checks, installs or updates ``anet``, starts the node, joins a hub and "
"runs ``anet doctor``."
msgstr "检查、安装或更新 ``anet``\\ ，启动节点，加入 hub，并运行 ``anet doctor``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:410
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:411
msgid "``/anet-status``"
msgstr "``/anet-status``"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:412
msgid "Reports the node, its hub, the balance and the spending limits."
msgstr "报告节点、其 hub、余额和支出限额。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:414
msgid ""
"The plugin has no hooks, opens no network connection and writes no files "
"of its own. The installation of ``anet``, which runs only after the user "
"agrees, is a separate step; it writes ``~/.local/bin/anet`` and the data "
"directory ``~/.anet``. Every ``anet`` command of the plugin runs through "
"the script ``bin/anet-run.sh``, which applies the two settings described "
"under `Plugin settings`_. Without the setting ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``, the "
"script looks for ``anet`` in ``PATH``, then in ``~/.local/bin``, "
"``/usr/local/bin`` and ``/opt/homebrew/bin``. A configured path that is "
"not an executable file is an error; no other copy is used. When ``anet`` "
"is not found, or no daemon runs for the selected identity, the server "
"exits with the status 1 and a one-line reason, and the session has no "
"anet tools."
msgstr ""
"该插件不含 Hook，不建立任何网络连接，自身也不写入任何文件。``anet`` 的安装是单独的步骤，仅在用户同意后执行，会写入 "
"``~/.local/bin/anet`` 和数据目录 ``~/.anet``。插件的每条 ``anet`` 命令都经由脚本 ``bin"
"/anet-run.sh`` 执行，该脚本应用 `插件设置项`_ 中所述的两项设置。未设置 ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` 时，脚本先在 "
"``PATH`` 中查找 ``anet``，再依次查找 ``~/.local/bin``、``/usr/local/bin`` 和 "
"``/opt/homebrew/bin``。若所配置的路径不是可执行文件，则视为错误，不会改用其他副本。找不到 "
"``anet``，或所选身份没有运行中的守护进程时，服务器以状态码 1 退出并给出一行原因，会话中不会出现 anet 工具。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:425
msgid "Installing the plugin"
msgstr "安装插件"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:427
msgid ""
"The source of the plugin is ``deploy/plugins`` in the ANet repository; "
"the generated Cursor plugin is ``deploy/plugins/dist/cursor``. The "
"repository is added as a plugin marketplace:"
msgstr ""
"插件的源码位于 ANet 仓库的 ``deploy/plugins``\\ ；生成的 Cursor 插件位于 "
"``deploy/plugins/dist/cursor``\\ 。将该仓库添加为插件市场："

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:435
msgid ""
"Alternatively, import the same repository as a team marketplace in the "
"Cursor dashboard. To try the plugin from a local copy, start the command-"
"line program with ``cursor-agent --plugin-dir <directory of the "
"plugin>``."
msgstr ""
"也可以在 Cursor 控制台中将同一仓库导入为团队市场。若要从本地副本试用插件，请以 ``cursor-agent --plugin-dir "
"<插件目录>`` 启动命令行程序。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:439
msgid ""
"The plugin requires Linux or macOS. ``anet`` has no Windows build, so the"
" plugin does not work on Windows. The ``anet-setup`` skill installs "
"``anet`` when it is missing, and needs ``curl``, ``gzip`` and ``ssh-"
"keygen`` (OpenSSH 8.1 or later) for that."
msgstr ""
"插件要求 Linux 或 macOS。\\ ``anet`` 没有 Windows 版本，因此插件不能在 Windows 上使用。\\ "
"``anet`` 缺失时，技能 ``anet-setup`` 会安装它，这需要 ``curl``、\\ ``gzip`` 和 ``ssh-"
"keygen``\\ （OpenSSH 8.1 或更高版本）。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:445
msgid "Setting up the node from Cursor"
msgstr "在 Cursor 中设置节点"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:447
msgid "If ``anet`` is not installed or not running, ask in a session:"
msgstr "若 ``anet`` 尚未安装或未运行，请在会话中输入："

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:453
msgid ""
"The agent follows the ``anet-setup`` skill. It looks for ``anet`` and "
"reports the version. When ``anet`` is missing, it states what the "
"installer does and runs it only after the user agrees; the installer is "
"downloaded from ``agentnetwork.org.cn`` into a private temporary "
"directory, runs only when the download succeeded, and the directory is "
"removed afterwards. It starts the node with ``anet up``, asks which hub "
"to join and under which name, runs ``anet hub-register``, and runs ``anet"
" doctor``. The commands that change who may reach the machine or what it "
"may spend (``anet peers``, ``anet inbound``, ``anet autoreply set``, the "
"spending limits and ``anet pay``) are named by the agent and left to the "
"user on a terminal. Start a new session afterwards, so that the MCP "
"server starts."
msgstr ""
"智能体按技能 ``anet-setup`` 执行。它查找 ``anet`` 并报告版本。\\ ``anet`` "
"缺失时，它先说明安装程序的作用，待用户同意后才运行；安装程序下载到私有临时目录，仅在下载成功后运行，结束后删除该目录，下载来源为 "
"``agentnetwork.org.cn``\\ 。随后它用 ``anet up`` 启动节点，询问要加入的 hub 及使用的名称，运行 "
"``anet hub-register``\\ ，并运行 ``anet doctor``\\ 。凡改变谁可以访问本机或可以支出多少的命令（\\ "
"``anet peers``、\\ ``anet inbound``、\\ ``anet autoreply set``\\ 、支出限额和 "
"``anet pay``\\ ），智能体只指明命令，交由用户在终端中执行。设置完成后请开启新会话，以便 MCP 服务器启动。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:466
msgid "Plugin verification"
msgstr "插件验证"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:468
msgid ""
"The steps below were run with a stand-in for the Cursor client, which "
"started the server in the way the Cursor command-line bundle was found to"
" start it. They were run with the plugin script ``bin/anet-run.sh``, the "
"script ``bin/anet-mcp.sh`` and ``anet`` 0.3.3 in a fresh home directory:"
msgstr ""
"以下步骤使用 Cursor 客户端的替代程序执行，该程序按对 Cursor "
"命令行程序包的分析所得的方式启动服务器。步骤在全新的主目录中，使用插件脚本 ``bin/anet-run.sh``、脚本 ``bin/anet-"
"mcp.sh`` 和 ``anet`` 0.3.3 执行："

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:473
msgid ""
"``bin/anet-run.sh --resolve`` reported the executable in "
"``~/.local/bin``, the version and the identity ``default``."
msgstr ""
"``bin/anet-run.sh --resolve`` 报告了位于 ``~/.local/bin`` 的可执行文件、版本，以及身份 "
"``default``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:475
msgid ""
"``up``, ``hub-register`` and ``status`` through the script started the "
"node, registered it at a hub and showed the key confirmed by the hub. "
"``doctor`` reported every check as ``ok`` or ``info``, except the "
"expected warning for the missing identity recovery."
msgstr ""
"经脚本执行 ``up``、\\ ``hub-register`` 和 ``status``\\ ，节点已启动、已在 hub 注册，且密钥已由 "
"hub 确认。``doctor`` 报告的各项检查均为 ``ok`` 或 ``info``\\ ，仅有一项预期的警告，即尚未设置身份恢复。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:479
msgid ""
"``bin/anet-mcp.sh`` listed the 14 tools. ``node_status`` and "
"``list_agents`` worked, and a delegation through ``send_message``, "
"``wait_task`` and ``get_task`` to a free capability ended in "
"``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED`` with ``anet.effect_status`` ``OK`` and a "
"verifiable receipt."
msgstr ""
"``bin/anet-mcp.sh`` 列出了 14 个工具。\\ ``node_status`` 与 ``list_agents`` "
"正常工作；经 ``send_message``、\\ ``wait_task`` 和 ``get_task`` 向一项免费能力委派的任务，以 "
"``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED`` 结束，``anet.effect_status`` 为 ``OK``\\ ，并带有可验证的回执。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:483
msgid ""
"Without a running daemon, the script exits with the status 1 and the "
"reason ``the daemon is not answering``."
msgstr "没有运行中的守护进程时，脚本以状态 1 退出，原因为 ``the daemon is not answering``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:486
msgid ""
"In Cursor itself, run ``/anet-status`` in a new session after the "
"installation. The agent calls ``node_status`` and ``get_balance`` and "
"reports the identity, the hub, the inbound policy and the limits. Whether"
" Cursor lists the command under this name has not been observed; see "
"`Plugin: not tested`_."
msgstr ""
"在 Cursor 中，安装后请在新会话里运行 ``/anet-status``\\ 。智能体调用 ``node_status`` 和 "
"``get_balance``\\ ，并报告身份、hub、入站策略和限额。Cursor 是否以此名称列出该命令，尚未观察到；参见 "
"`插件：未经测试`_\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:492
msgid "Plugin settings"
msgstr "插件设置项"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:494
msgid ""
"The plugin declares two optional variables. The MCP server receives their"
" values as environment variables of the same names; an empty variable "
"selects the default."
msgstr "插件声明了两个可选变量。MCP 服务器以同名环境变量的形式接收它们的值；变量为空时使用默认值。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:502
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:503
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:504
msgid "``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``"
msgstr "``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:505
msgid ""
"A named identity (``anet id ls``). Empty selects the default identity in "
"``~/.anet``. The server then runs ``anet --id <name> mcp``."
msgstr ""
"命名身份（\\ ``anet id ls``\\ ）。为空时选择 ``~/.anet`` 中的默认身份。服务器随后运行 ``anet --id "
"<name> mcp``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:507
msgid "``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``"
msgstr "``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:508
msgid ""
"The absolute path of the ``anet`` executable. Empty searches the "
"locations named above."
msgstr "``anet`` 可执行文件的绝对路径。为空时在上述位置中查找。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:511
msgid ""
"Cursor has no per-user settings file for a plugin. The setup skill and "
"the status command run ``bin/anet-run.sh`` in a shell of the agent, where"
" the script reads the same two names from the environment; a non-default "
"value may therefore have to be set both in the plugin configuration and "
"in that environment. With the identity ``work`` selected while only the "
"default identity runs, the script exits with the status 1, reports that "
"``anet`` is not running for the data directory of ``work``, and names the"
" command to start it. With an ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` that is not an "
"executable file, the script exits with the status 1 and the message that "
"the setting names a file that is not executable; nothing is installed."
msgstr ""
"Cursor 没有针对单个用户的插件设置文件。设置技能与状态命令在智能体的 shell 中运行 ``bin/anet-run.sh``\\ "
"，脚本从该环境中读取同样的两个名称；因此，非默认值可能需要同时在插件配置和该环境中设置。选择身份 ``work``\\ "
"而仅有默认身份在运行时，脚本以状态 1 退出，报告 ``work`` 的数据目录下 ``anet`` 未运行，并给出启动命令。\\ "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` 不是可执行文件时，脚本以状态 1 退出，并提示该设置所指的文件不可执行；不会安装任何内容。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:523
msgid "Updating and removing the plugin"
msgstr "更新和移除插件"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:525
msgid ""
"A new version of the plugin is taken from the marketplace by the update "
"function of Cursor. ``anet update`` updates ANet itself, independently of"
" the plugin. Removing the plugin does not change the node: the identity "
"in ``~/.anet`` and the running daemon remain. :doc:`../intro/install` "
"describes how to stop the node and remove ANet."
msgstr ""
"插件的新版本由 Cursor 的更新功能从市场获取。\\ ``anet update`` 更新 ANet "
"本身，与插件无关。移除插件不会改变节点：``~/.anet`` 中的身份和运行中的守护进程保持不变。停止节点和移除 ANet 的方法见 "
":doc:`../intro/install`\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:532
msgid "Plugin: not tested"
msgstr "插件：未经测试"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:534
msgid ""
"The command-line agent of Cursor requires a Cursor account, and no run "
"with the real client was possible. The following has not been observed:"
msgstr "Cursor 命令行智能体需要 Cursor 账户，因此无法使用真实客户端运行。以下内容尚未观察到："

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:537
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"That Cursor loads the plugin, starts the server from "
"``${CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT}/bin/anet-mcp.sh``, lists the skills and the "
"command, and runs ``/anet-status``."
msgstr ""
"Cursor 是否加载插件、是否从 ``${CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT}/bin/anet-mcp.sh`` "
"启动服务器、是否列出技能和命令，以及 ``/anet-status`` 是否可运行。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:540
msgid ""
"Where Cursor takes the values of ``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` and "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` from in the desktop application and in the command-"
"line agent, and whether a user of an individual plan can set plugin "
"variables. The Cursor documentation describes the team dashboard."
msgstr ""
"在桌面应用和命令行智能体中，Cursor 从何处获取 ``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` 与 ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``"
" 的值，以及个人套餐的用户能否设置插件变量。Cursor 文档仅描述了团队控制台。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:544
msgid ""
"That the agent resolves the path ``<skill-dir>/../../bin/anet-run.sh`` of"
" the skills and the ``<plugin-root>`` of the status command, because "
"Cursor has no skill-directory variable."
msgstr ""
"智能体能否解析技能中的路径 ``<skill-dir>/../../bin/anet-run.sh`` 以及状态命令中的 ``<plugin-"
"root>``\\ ，因为 Cursor 没有技能目录变量。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:547
msgid ""
"Adding the ANet repository as a marketplace, which needs the catalogue "
"file ``.cursor-plugin/marketplace.json`` at the repository root, and the "
"nested plugin path in the live product. The catalogue and the plugin "
"manifest pass the schema validator of the Cursor plugin repository."
msgstr ""
"将 ANet 仓库添加为市场（这需要仓库根目录下的目录文件 ``.cursor-plugin/marketplace.json``\\ "
"），以及嵌套的插件路径在正式产品中的表现。目录文件和插件清单已通过 Cursor 插件仓库的模式校验器。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:551
msgid ""
"The setup skill driven by a model, including the installer download in "
"this flow, and the wording of the skills in a model session."
msgstr "由模型驱动的设置技能（包括该流程中的安装程序下载），以及技能措辞在模型会话中的表现。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:553
msgid ""
"The plugin on macOS and on Windows (including WSL2), the PATH of the "
"desktop application, and the review for the Cursor Marketplace."
msgstr "插件在 macOS 和 Windows（含 WSL2）上的表现、桌面应用的 PATH，以及 Cursor Marketplace 的审核。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:557
msgid "Plugin: troubleshooting"
msgstr "插件：故障排除"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:563
msgid "Symptom"
msgstr "现象"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:565
msgid "The session has no anet tools."
msgstr "会话中没有 anet 工具。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:566
msgid ""
"Run ``anet status`` in a terminal. ``[daemon_not_running]``: run ``anet "
"up``. ``anet`` not found: set ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` or ask the agent to run"
" the ``anet-setup`` skill. Then start a new session."
